WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.420
The snake was moving.

00:03.540 --> 00:07.290
That tells us. But how did it move?

00:07.410 --> 00:13.460
Alliteration is when words close together start with the same sound.

00:13.580 --> 00:17.180
The sneaky snake slid slowly by.

00:17.300 --> 00:20.190
Now we can almost hear it hiss!

00:20.310 --> 00:25.630
Here is one more. In the pond, I saw five fat frogs.

00:25.750 --> 00:32.839
So look for the same first sound, again and again, and try one in your own writing!
